{"id":"wb-8-241","name":"长则普明寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"长则普明寺","text":"长则普明寺是一座古建筑，位于山西省晋中市平遥县襄垣乡长则村。\n该寺在明代重修，正殿是典型明代建筑，保存有明代的精美壁画。\n2019年10月7日，长则普明寺公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E5%88%99%E6%99%AE%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92659605,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92659605","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}